Package: nju-hpc-sync
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: NJU-HPC Sync Maintainers <noreply@nju-hpc.local>
Depends: rsync, openssh-client, libc6 (>= 2.35), libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libx11-6, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxext6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: Graphical rsync and OpenSSH client for NJU-HPC
 NJU-HPC Sync is a PySide6 desktop frontend that builds shell-free rsync
 commands and delegates SSH configuration and transport to system OpenSSH.
